  "改好了，下周一下午三点，还是那家诊所。前一天晚上我再提醒你一次。": "Done, next Monday at 3 p.m., same clinic. I'll remind you again the night before.",
  "在主线里主动跟用户说一声：用一两句话说这件做完了、结果大概是什么，然后问“要我念给你听吗？”。他说要，就用 send_voice 把结果的口语稿念给他听；说不用就算了。": "Tell the user in the main chat: say in a sentence or two that this is done and roughly how it turned out, then ask “Want me to read it to you?”. If they say yes, use send_voice to read a spoken version. If not, leave it.",
  "【任务做完】后台有一件事做完了（运行时发来的，不是用户说的）：": "[Task done] Something finished in the background (sent by the runtime, not said by the user):",
  "定时触发的普通任务 t-brief「每天早上出早报」的第 3 次运行做完了（触发：10 月 7 日（周三）08:00 到点）。\n它最后说：\n早报写好了：brief.md（9 条；昨天那份补不回来了，新闻源今天恢复了）。\n交付的文件（在任务的产出区里）：brief.md": "Run 3 of scheduled plain task t-brief “Morning brief every day” finished (trigger: Wed, Oct 7, 08:00).\nIts last words:\nThe brief is ready: brief.md (9 items; yesterday's can't be recovered, the news source came back today).\nDelivered files (in the task's output area): brief.md",
  "t-brief「每天早上出早报」第 3 次运行做完了，交了 1 个文件": "Run 3 of t-brief “Morning brief every day” finished, delivered 1 file",
  "【负责人来信】后台的一个 agent 让你转告用户一件事（运行时转交的，不是用户说的）：": "[Owner message] A background agent asked you to pass something on to the user (forwarded by the runtime, not said by the user):",
  "定时触发的普通任务 t-brief「每天早上出早报」的负责人（第 3 次运行时）说：\n今天的早报做了网页版，Bun 这周 star 涨得最快，值得看一眼。\n（附了 1 个文件：{}（附件引用 {}））": "The owner of scheduled plain task t-brief “Morning brief every day” (during run 3) says:\nToday's brief has a web version. Bun gained the most stars this week, worth a look.\n(1 file attached: {} (attachment ref {}))",
  "附件已经作为附件卡片放在这条通知后面给用户看了，用户点得开（预览或下载），不用再用 send_attachment 发一遍；要看内容用 read_attachment（附件引用写在上面的文件名后面）。转告时提一句附了什么。": "The file is already on an attachment card after this notice. The user can open it (preview or download), so no need to send it again with send_attachment. To read it, use read_attachment (the ref is after the file name above). Mention what's attached when you pass this on.",
  "在主线里主动用你自己的话转告用户：是哪个项目或任务的谁（负责人、子 agent、评审）、说了什么；要用户做什么就说清楚。项目内部的细节只到它写的这些，不要追问。然后问“要我念给你听吗？”。他说要，就用 send_voice 把口语稿念给他听；说不用就算了。": "Pass this on to the user in the main chat, in your own words: which project or task, who said it (owner, sub-agent, reviewer) and what they said. If the user needs to do something, say so. Project details stop at what's written here, so don't dig further. Then ask “Want me to read it to you?”. If they say yes, use send_voice to read a spoken version. If not, leave it.",
  "早报做了网页版，Bun 这周 star 涨得最快": "The brief has a web version. Bun gained the most stars this week",
  "早报那边说今天还做了网页版，Bun 这周 star 涨得最快，值得看一眼。网页版就在下面，点「预览」能看。要我念给你听吗？": "The morning brief says there's a web version today, and Bun gained the most stars this week. Worth a look. It's right below, click Preview to see it. Want me to read it to you?",
  "今天的早报出好了：9 条，开源数据库 5.0 和 Vite 7.2.1 是重点；昨天新闻源连不上，那份补不回来了。早报就在下面，点「预览」能看。要我念给你听吗？": "Today's brief is out: 9 items, with open-source database 5.0 and Vite 7.2.1 as the highlights. The news source was down yesterday, so that one can't be recovered. It's right below, click Preview to see it. Want me to read it to you?",
