  "等空闲后重启二狗": "Restart ergo when idle",
  "先问用户：等空闲后重启二狗（lsm_restart_self），命中关注类别「不可逆的提交」（对话里为\"先问我\"）；特别敏感的操作，对话审批关着也要用户授权。守护进程会请用户审批，批准后才执行；不要换个写法绕过。":
    "Ask the user first: Restart ergo when idle (lsm_restart_self) hits the watch category “Irreversible commit” (“ask me first” in chat); an especially sensitive action, so it needs your approval even with chat approvals off. The daemon will ask the user to approve; it runs only once approved. Don't work around it another way.",
  "周末想去跑步。我之前存过一篇跑步入门的文章，再提醒下我有什么要注意的？": "I want to go for a run this weekend. I saved an article on getting started with running. Remind me what to watch out for?",
  "用户问存过的跑步文章和要注意的事：先查记忆，找那篇文章和他说过的身体情况。": "User asked about a saved running article and what to watch for. Check memory first: find the article and what they've said about their health.",
  "跑步 入门": "running basics",
  "用户问之前存的跑步入门文章，找出来照着给建议": "User asked about a saved running article. Find it and base the advice on it",
  "身体 旧伤 过敏 体检": "health old injury allergy checkup",
  "看用户说过哪些身体上要注意的（旧伤、过敏、体检）": "See what the user has said about their health (old injuries, allergies, checkups)",
  "照你存的那篇《秋季跑步入门》：第一周每次 3 公里、跑走结合，心率别超过 150；天凉了跑前多热身五分钟。\n\n另外几件事：你左膝盖有旧伤，先在平路上跑、别冲坡；下周三上午你要体检，前一天别跑太猛；你说过对芒果过敏，路上补给别买芒果味的能量胶。": "From the piece you saved, “Fall running basics”: in week one, run 3 km at a time mixing running and walking, and keep your heart rate under 150. It's getting cooler, so warm up five minutes longer.\n\nA few other things: your left knee has an old injury, so stick to flat ground and don't charge up hills. You have a checkup next Wednesday morning, so go easy the day before. You also said you're allergic to mangoes, so skip mango-flavored energy gels.",
  "用户从第 2 阶段「找出重复并移进回收区」重做（你手头那一轮已经停下）：重开了 s2（回到未开始，验收结果清掉），其余阶段不动。用户说：「第 3 组是连拍，不算重复，要留着」。再按依赖重新开始、重做。": "The user is redoing from stage 2 “Find duplicates and move them to the recycle area” (your current round has stopped): s2 was reopened (back to not started, acceptance results cleared) and other stages are untouched. The user says: “Set 3 is a burst, not duplicates. Keep them.” Restart and redo by dependency order.",
  "你从「找出重复并移进回收区」重做（只重做这一阶段）。你说：「第 3 组是连拍，不算重复，要留着」": "You're redoing from “Find duplicates and move them to the recycle area” (this stage only). You said: “Set 3 is a burst, not duplicates. Keep them.”",
  "任务书：把相册库和家庭网盘里 2015 年以来的照片去重、按事件归档。约束：重复的先放回收区，不直接删。涉及项目：相册库、家庭网盘。": "Brief: dedupe photos since 2015 across the photo library and the family drive, and file them by event. Constraint: duplicates go to a recycle area first, no direct deletes. Projects: Photo library, Family drive.",
  "两个项目都要扫描，跨项目任务只能派工单，不能直接动它们的目录。": "Both projects need scanning. A cross-project task can only send work orders, it can't touch their folders directly.",
  "计划交上来了，请过目。": "Plan's ready, please take a look.",
  "计划已确认（勾掉 1 项授权：直接删除回收区）。进入第 1 阶段。": "Plan confirmed (1 permission unchecked: delete the recycle area outright). Starting stage 1.",
