  "回执：W-21、W-22 都已完成。第 1 阶段验收通过（脚本：清单覆盖两个目录；评审：要整理的目录都在清单里）。": "Receipt: W-21 and W-22 are both done. Stage 1 accepted (script: the list covers both folders; review: every folder to sort is on the list).",
  "python dedupe.py --dry-run /示例/相册 /示例/网盘/旧手机照片": "python dedupe.py --dry-run /example/photos /example/drive/old-phone-photos",
