  "等你批准": "Waiting for your OK",
  "任务书：每周一把上周三张卡的账单导出、去重、分类，汇总进「记账本」，出一页周报。约束：历史账目不能丢；邮件正文别看。涉及项目：记账本。": "Brief: every Monday, export last week's statements from three cards, dedupe and categorize them, add them to “Ledger”, and produce a one-page report. Constraints: no old records lost; don't read email bodies. Project: Ledger.",
  "只涉及记账本一个项目，按规格应该由记账本的负责人执行；这里演示的是计划卡本身。对话里的两条限制要编译成规则和授权收窄。": "This only involves Ledger, so by the rules Ledger's owner should run it. This just shows the plan card itself. The two limits from the chat become a rule and a narrower permission.",
  "计划草稿好了。你在对话里说的两条限制，我编成了一条时序规则和一条授权收窄，写在卡片上。": "The plan draft is ready. I turned the two limits you mentioned into an ordering rule and a narrower permission. Both are on the card.",
