  "以后月结单直接从邮箱里拿吧，别让我手动下载了": "From now on, pull monthly statements from email. I don't want to download them by hand.",
  "我现在的工具包里没有读邮箱的工具，这件事也不在任何任务里。你在项目的工具包里给我加上读邮箱的 MCP 之后，我再从邮箱里拿月结单。": "My toolkit doesn't have an email tool, and this isn't part of any task. Add an email MCP to the project's toolkit and I'll pull the statements from there.",
  "这改了立项书里的目标和范围，提了一张立项要求变更，卡在这里，点确认就生效：": "This changes the goal and scope in the charter, so I've filed a charter change. It's held here until you click confirm:",
  "范围审视：这段读了「家庭网盘」项目里的一个文件，没有授权，记为越界。": "Scope review: this part read a file in project “Family drive” without permission. Logged as out of scope.",
