  "普通任务 t-song「下载《晴天》的音频」（助理交给你的）：要做的事——\n搜一下周杰伦《晴天》，把音频下载成 mp3，放进工作目录，文件名写歌名\n直接动手做，一轮轮做到交付为止；做完了用一两句话说清做成了什么、结果在哪。": "Plain task t-song “Download the audio for ‘Sunny Day’” (handed to you by the assistant). What to do:\nFind “Sunny Day” by Jay Chou, download the audio as an mp3 to the working folder, and name the file after the song\nJust get on with it, round by round until it's delivered. When done, say in a sentence or two what got done and where the result is.",
  "先搜到能下载的来源，再用 yt-dlp 抽音频转 mp3。": "Find a source first, then pull the audio with yt-dlp and convert to mp3.",
