  "summary=官方有录音室版和现场版，先下了录音室版 text=官方有录音室版和现场版两个版本，我先下了录音室版；要现场版的话在任务里跟我说一声。": "summary=Studio and live versions exist, got studio first text=There's a studio version and a live version, and I got the studio one first. If you want the live one, say so in the task.",
  "已交给{}：它闲着时会在主线里转告用户（它正在和用户说话的，等这一轮说完）。": "Handed to {}: when free, it'll pass this on to the user in the main chat (if it's talking with the user, after that turn ends).",
