  "普通任务 t-song「下载《晴天》的音频」的负责人说：\n官方有录音室版和现场版两个版本，我先下了录音室版；要现场版的话在任务里跟我说一声。": "The owner of plain task t-song “Download the audio for ‘Sunny Day’” says:\nThere's a studio version and a live version, and I got the studio one first. If you want the live one, say so in the task.",
