  "后台下《晴天》的那边说：官方有录音室版和现场版，它先下了录音室版；要现场版的话跟我说一声。要我念给你听吗？": "The “Sunny Day” download says there's a studio version and a live version, and it got the studio one first. If you want the live one, just tell me. Want me to read this to you?",
  "普通任务 t-song「下载《晴天》的音频」在后台做完了。\n它最后说：\n下好了：工作目录里的「晴天.mp3」（4.2 MB，4 分 29 秒，来自官方 MV）。\n交付的文件（在任务的产出区里）：晴天.mp3": "Plain task t-song “Download the audio for ‘Sunny Day’” finished in the background.\nIts last words:\nDone: “sunny-day.mp3” in the working folder (4.2 MB, 4 min 29 s, from the official video).\nDelivered files (in the task's output area): sunny-day.mp3",
