  "这周要交三份材料：周三交季度报告，周四交报销单，周五交周报。表和提交入口我发在下面了。": "Three documents are due this week: the quarterly report on Wednesday, the expense form on Thursday, and the weekly report on Friday. The table and submission links are below.",
