  "早报写好了：brief.md（9 条；昨天那份补不回来了，新闻源今天恢复了）。网页版和走势图也发在这里了，点开就能看。": "Brief's ready: brief.md (9 items; yesterday's can't be recovered, the news source came back today). The web version and the trend chart are here too, just open them.",
