  "记下了。你妈妈住得离你们近吗？是住一起、同城，还是在老家？": "Got it. Does your mom live near you? With you, in the same city, or in your hometown?",
  "在老家，过年才回去。": "In my hometown. We go back for New Year.",
  "平时和爸妈联系多吗？每周打电话、偶尔视频，还是有事才联系？": "Do you talk to your parents much? Weekly calls, the odd video chat, or only when something comes up?",
  "我跟我爸关系一般，这个别记。": "My dad and I aren't that close. Don't save that.",
  "好，这段不记。": "OK, not saving that.",
  "今天我记下了这些（是我的理解，不是结论）：\n\n1. 你和爱人、女儿住，女儿六岁、在上一年级；\n2. 平时主要是你爱人接送，你下班晚；\n3. 父母在老家，过年回去；\n4. 你妈妈生日是 3 月 2 日。\n\n对不对？要改哪里？": "Here's what I noted today (my understanding, not conclusions):\n\n1. You live with your spouse and daughter. She's six and in first grade;\n2. Your spouse usually does drop-off and pick-up, since you get off work late;\n3. Your parents live in your hometown and you go back for New Year;\n4. Your mom's birthday is March 2.\n\nIs that right? Anything to change?",
  "…3. 父母在老家，过年回去；4. 你妈妈生日是 3 月 2 日。对不对？要改哪里？": "…3. Your parents live in your hometown and you go back for New Year; 4. Your mom's birthday is March 2. Is that right? Anything to change?",
  "对，就是这些。": "Yes, that's it.",
  "这次访谈结束了：「家里的人和基本情况」记成聊过。你说的 4 段话标着「来自访谈」记进了素材，今晚整理时会用到；管理员的总结不会直接写成结论。": "Interview finished: “Family and the basics” is marked as talked about. The 4 things you said went into materials tagged “from an interview”, and tonight's consolidation will use them. The curator's summary doesn't become conclusions directly.",
  "这次听到的档案信息放在上面那张卡里，你逐条看一眼再确认。这次就聊到这里，谢谢你，下周再约你聊聊工作和一天怎么过。": "The profile details I heard are on the card above. Check each one and confirm. That's all for today, thanks. Next week let's talk about work and how your day goes.",
